    "source": "analytic",
    "note": "the path starts at the point nearest the box (its middle, x 15); Distribution Extent (Fusion's default): 3 instances over 40, so the copies are 20 and 40 along it (x 20 .. 50 and 40 .. 70), 1600 each"
  }
